    {
      "id": "la-q008",
      "title": "特征值计算",
      "content": "求矩阵 $A = [2, 1; 1, 2]$ 的特征值和特征向量。",
      "type": "solution",
      "difficulty": 3,
      "knowledgeNodeIds": [
        "la-eigenvalue-eigenvector",
        "la-determinant-2x2"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\lambda_1 = 3$，特征向量 $k_1(1,1)$（$k_1 \\neq 0$）；$\\lambda_2 = 1$，特征向量 $k_2(1,-1)$（$k_2 \\neq 0$）",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "特征方程：$\\det(A - \\lambda I) = \\det([2-\\lambda, 1; 1, 2-\\lambda]) = (2-\\lambda)^2 - 1 = 0$。",
        "展开：$\\lambda^2 - 4\\lambda + 3 = (\\lambda-3)(\\lambda-1) = 0$。",
        "$\\lambda_1 = 3$：$(A - 3I)x = 0 \\to [-1, 1; 1, -1]x = 0 \\to x = k_1(1,1)$。",
        "$\\lambda_2 = 1$：$(A - I)x = 0 \\to [1, 1; 1, 1]x = 0 \\to x = k_2(1,-1)$。"
      ],
      "hints": [
        {
          "level": "L1",
          "text": "先解特征方程 $\\det(A - \\lambda I) = 0$求特征值。"
        },
        {
          "level": "L2",
          "text": "对每个特征值 $\\lambda$，解齐次方程组 $(A - \\lambda I)x = 0$求特征向量。"
        },
        {
          "level": "L3",
          "text": "特征值之和 =迹 $= 2+2 = 4$，特征值之积 =行列式 $= 3$。验证：$3+1=4, 3\\times1=3$。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "title": "TeacherAgent original linear algebra questions",
        "license": "original_generated",
        "sourceType": "human_authored",
        "note": "Original TeacherAgent draft; no source text copied."
      }
    },
