      "content": "矩阵 $A = [4, 1; 2, 3]$ 能否对角化？如果能，写出 $A = PDP^{-1}$。",
      "type": "solution",
      "difficulty": 3,
      "knowledgeNodeIds": [
        "la-diagonalization",
        "la-eigenvalue-eigenvector"
      ],
      "answer": "可以。$A = PDP^{-1}$，其中 $P = [1, 1; 1, -2]$，$D = [5, 0; 0, 2]$",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "特征方程：$(4-\\lambda)(3-\\lambda) - 2 = \\lambda^2 - 7\\lambda + 10 = (\\lambda-5)(\\lambda-2) = 0$。",
        "$\\lambda_1 = 5$：$(A-5I)x = 0 \\to [-1, 1; 2, -2]x = 0 \\to x_1 = (1, 1)$。",
        "$\\lambda_2 = 2$：$(A-2I)x = 0 \\to [2, 1; 2, 1]x = 0 \\to x_2 = (1, -2)$。",
        "两个特征值不同，特征向量线性无关，可以对角化。",
        "$P = [1, 1; 1, -2]$，$D = [5, 0; 0, 2]$。"
      ],
      "hints": [
        {
          "level": "L1",
          "text": "先求特征值和特征向量。"
        },
        {
          "level": "L2",
          "text": "$2\\times2$矩阵有两个不同特征值时一定可对角化。"
        },
        {
          "level": "L3",
          "text": "P 的列是特征向量，D 的对角元素是对应的特征值。"
        }
      ],
