      "id": "la-q011",
      "title": "正交投影",
      "content": "求向量 $(3, 4)$在向量 $(1, 0)$方向上的正交投影。",
      "type": "solution",
      "difficulty": 3,
      "knowledgeNodeIds": [
        "la-orthogonality",
        "la-vector-definition"
      ],
      "answer": "投影为 $(3, 0)$",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "投影公式：$proj_u(v) = (\\langle v, \\frac{u\\rangle}{\\langle u,} u\\rangle) \\times u$。",
        "$u = (1, 0), v = (3, 4)$。",
        "$\\langle v, u\\rangle = 3\\times1 + 4\\times0 = 3$。",
        "$\\langle u, u\\rangle = 1\\times1 + 0\\times0 = 1$。",
        "$proj = (\\frac{3}{1}) \\times (1, 0) = (3, 0)$。"
      ],
      "hints": [
        {
          "level": "L1",
          "text": "正交投影的公式是什么？"
        },
        {
          "level": "L2",
          "text": "$proj_u(v) = (\\langle v,u\\rangle/\\langle u,u\\rangle)u$，先算内积。"
        },
        {
          "level": "L3",
          "text": "投影误差 $v -$proj $= (0, 4)$，它和 $u = (1, 0)$正交，验证了投影的正确性。"
        }
      ],
